  "code": "def gorev(ad, adim):\n    for i in range(1, adim + 1):\n        print(ad, \"adım\", i)\n        yield\n\n\nkuyruk = [gorev(\"A\", 1), gorev(\"B\", 2)]\nwhile kuyruk:\n    g = kuyruk.pop(0)\n    try:\n        next(g)\n        kuyruk.append(g)\n    except StopIteration:\n        print(\"bir görev bitti\")\nprint(\"tüm görevler bitti\")",
